OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786745069
OL,3,CPotentially deadly livestock virus
OL,4,Cfound in Scotland for first time
OL,6,FA case of the bluetongue virus has
OL,7,Fbeen recorded in livestock in Scotland
OL,8,Ffor the first time.
OL,10,FThe potentially deadly disease, BTV-3,
OL,11,For bluetongue, was confirmed in
OL,12,FDumfries and Galloway on August 8.
OL,14,FThe Scottish Government said the
OL,15,Fanimal has been euthanised on welfare
OL,16,Fgrounds, and the farm affected is
OL,17,Funder restrictions.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/5
