PN,32602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786745069
OL,3,CPotentially deadly livestock virus
OL,4,Cfound in Scotland for first time
OL,6,FThe animal was tested following
OL,7,Freports of suspicious clinical signs,
OL,8,Fand epidemiological investigations are
OL,9,Fongoing to establish the likely source
OL,10,Fof infection.
OL,12,FThere have been 289 cases of
OL,13,Fbluetongue serotype 3 (BTV-3) in the
OL,14,FUK in the 2026 to 2027 bluetongue
OL,15,Fseason.
OL,17,F283 of those are in England, with most
OL,18,Fin the south-west of the country.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/5
