PN,32604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786745069
OL,3,CPotentially deadly livestock virus
OL,4,Cfound in Scotland for first time
OL,6,FScotland's chief veterinary officer
OL,7,FSheila Voas said: "At this stage it is
OL,8,Fnot possible to know if bluetongue is
OL,9,Fcirculating in Scotland, or whether
OL,10,Fthis is an individual case.
OL,12,F"The farm is under restriction while
OL,13,Finvestigations, including testing
OL,14,Fother susceptible animals, are ongoing.
OL,16,F"Vaccination remains the best way of
OL,17,Fpreventing disease in animals, and I
OL,18,Fencourage all farmers to discuss this
OL,19,Fwith their vets."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/5
