OL,3,CPotentially deadly livestock virus
OL,4,Cfound in Scotland for first time
OL,6,FBTV-3 is notifiable and any suspicion
OL,7,Fof disease in animals must be reported
OL,8,Fto Animal and Plant Health Agency
OL,9,FScotland.
